    "notes": "The named OSM way 947381552 and attached roof part match the PMTiles station. Model +X points from the northwest tracks to the southeast concourse. The mask keeps the independent hotel, concourse shops, roads, and waterway. The main station footprint and platform edges come from PMTiles. Vault heights, the steelwork pattern and the concourse are scaled exterior reconstructions from photographs. Track pairs between the mapped platforms are approximate and terminate inside the site model. The separately mapped hotel, streets, Underground and canal remain independent. Interiors beyond the visible platforms and concourse edge are outside the reconstruction."
